About this annotation

You noticed:

Annotations:
  sriovnetwork.openshift.io/state: Paused

This is only an annotation, not the MCP pause state.

The important field is:

Spec:
  Paused: false

Since Paused: false, your MCP is not paused. The annotation is a leftover from the previous SR-IOV operation and can safely be ignored. It will typically be updated or removed the next time the SR-IOV operator reconciles.

